{"data":{"id":1400879668,"totalResults":75,"items":[{"quote":"For me, Star Wars: Galactic Racer has become the perfect arcade racing game experience that leaves nothing to be desired. The sense of speed is the best it’s been since the first WipeOut, and it not only looks stunning, but sounds and plays that way, too. Even if you’re not a huge Star Wars fan, you should check out this game if only for its fresh roguelite ideas and the gripping campaign mode, which completely reinvents and revitalizes the sci-fi racing genre in turbo-boost mode.","score":100,"url":"https://de.ign.com/star-wars-galactic-racer/156125/star-wars-galactic-racer-im-test-burnout-dna-mit-roguelite-boost","date":"2026-10-02","author":"","authorSlug":null,"image":null,"publicationName":"IGN Deutschland","publicationSlug":"ign-deutschland","reviewedProduct":{"id":1400879668,"type":"games","title":"Star Wars: Galactic Racer","url":"/game/star-wars-galactic-racer/","criticScoreSummary":{"url":"/game/star-wars-galactic-racer/critic-reviews/?platform=playstation-5","score":88},"platform":{"id":1500000062,"name":"PlayStation 5"},"gameTaxonomy":{"game":{"id":1400879668,"name":"Star Wars: Galactic Racer"},"platform":{"id":1500000062,"name":"PlayStation 5"}}},"platform":"PlayStation 5"},{"quote":"Star Wars: Galactic Racer is not only one of the best racing games I have played all year, but after playing the campaign the full way through, it just might be one of my favourite racing games of all time.","score":100,"url":"https://www.radiotimes.com/technology/gaming/star-wars-galactic-racer-review/","date":"2026-10-02","author":"","authorSlug":null,"image":null,"publicationName":"Radio Times","publicationSlug":"radio-times","reviewedProduct":{"id":1400879668,"type":"games","title":"Star Wars: Galactic Racer","url":"/game/star-wars-galactic-racer/","criticScoreSummary":{"url":"/game/star-wars-galactic-racer/critic-reviews/?platform=playstation-5","score":88},"platform":{"id":1500000062,"name":"PlayStation 5"},"gameTaxonomy":{"game":{"id":1400879668,"name":"Star Wars: Galactic Racer"},"platform":{"id":1500000062,"name":"PlayStation 5"}}},"platform":"PlayStation 5"},{"quote":"Star Wars: Galactic Racer absolutely nails what it is trying to do. It is a high-octane racer that's endless fun to play, and it looks fantastic. This would have been a great game with a standard single-player mode, but what is here is inventive and engaging. I'd have loved a few silly classic characters and another planet or two, but this is a game I'll return to for a long time.","score":100,"url":"https://www.videogameschronicle.com/review/star-wars-galactic-racer-review/","date":"2026-10-02","author":"","authorSlug":null,"image":null,"publicationName":"VGC","publicationSlug":"vgc","reviewedProduct":{"id":1400879668,"type":"games","title":"Star Wars: Galactic Racer","url":"/game/star-wars-galactic-racer/","criticScoreSummary":{"url":"/game/star-wars-galactic-racer/critic-reviews/?platform=playstation-5","score":88},"platform":{"id":1500000062,"name":"PlayStation 5"},"gameTaxonomy":{"game":{"id":1400879668,"name":"Star Wars: Galactic Racer"},"platform":{"id":1500000062,"name":"PlayStation 5"}}},"platform":"PlayStation 5"},{"quote":"Star Wars: Galactic Racer is everything I hoped it would be. Fuse built a campaign that keeps giving me reasons to master the tracks, then made the racing feel good enough that I wanted to.  And for my fellow Episode I Racer lovers: Galactic Racer’s marketing has kept the podracers in the background, but don’t let that fool you. By the time I was done with the campaign, I found myself happy and whispering one thing to myself: Now this is podracing. ","score":100,"url":"https://giantbomb.com/reviews/star-wars-galactic-racer-review","date":"2026-10-02","author":"","authorSlug":null,"image":null,"publicationName":"Giant Bomb","publicationSlug":"giant-bomb","reviewedProduct":{"id":1400879668,"type":"games","title":"Star Wars: Galactic Racer","url":"/game/star-wars-galactic-racer/","criticScoreSummary":{"url":"/game/star-wars-galactic-racer/critic-reviews/?platform=playstation-5","score":88},"platform":{"id":1500000062,"name":"PlayStation 5"},"gameTaxonomy":{"game":{"id":1400879668,"name":"Star Wars: Galactic Racer"},"platform":{"id":1500000062,"name":"PlayStation 5"}}},"platform":"PlayStation 5"},{"quote":"These worlds don't just look beautiful, from Jakku's dunes and wrecked Star Destroyers you must thread between to Crait's white crystalline surface with red dust billowing underneath. They're also carved up into fascinating tracks that blend tight underground corridors where cornering is a constant discussion with death, and daringly wide-open outside sections where I once got so turned around I ended up going backwards. These are places that constantly shift in the way that they challenge you, and I suspect that better racers than me will spend an awfully long time working out the optimal strategies for handling each one.","score":100,"url":"https://www.eurogamer.net/star-wars-galactic-racer-review","date":"2026-10-02","author":"","authorSlug":null,"image":null,"publicationName":"Eurogamer","publicationSlug":"eurogamer","reviewedProduct":{"id":1400879668,"type":"games","title":"Star Wars: Galactic Racer","url":"/game/star-wars-galactic-racer/","criticScoreSummary":{"url":"/game/star-wars-galactic-racer/critic-reviews/?platform=playstation-5","score":88},"platform":{"id":1500000062,"name":"PlayStation 5"},"gameTaxonomy":{"game":{"id":1400879668,"name":"Star Wars: Galactic Racer"},"platform":{"id":1500000062,"name":"PlayStation 5"}}},"platform":"PlayStation 5"},{"quote":"Star Wars Galactic Racer is a Star-Wars-authentic thrill rush that may be the best racer in a decade. It’s such a wonderful, engaging experience that literally does everything right. Just be warned – as a roguelite – the on-ramp can take time while presenting a higher difficulty level.","score":98,"url":"https://www.impulsegamer.com/star-wars-galactic-racer-review-ps5-pro/","date":"2026-10-13","author":"","authorSlug":null,"image":null,"publicationName":"Impulsegamer","publicationSlug":"impulsegamer","reviewedProduct":{"id":1400879668,"type":"games","title":"Star Wars: Galactic Racer","url":"/game/star-wars-galactic-racer/","criticScoreSummary":{"url":"/game/star-wars-galactic-racer/critic-reviews/?platform=playstation-5","score":88},"platform":{"id":1500000062,"name":"PlayStation 5"},"gameTaxonomy":{"game":{"id":1400879668,"name":"Star Wars: Galactic Racer"},"platform":{"id":1500000062,"name":"PlayStation 5"}}},"platform":"PlayStation 5"},{"quote":"While the lack of local multiplayer is unfortunate, the decision to drop the mode so that the game is kept at a locked frame-rate is the right one. The game is so fast-paced that you need every millisecond possible. The tracks are all excellent, the music and sound effects are jaw-dropping, and both gameplay and customization have a ton of depth. The single player campaign is surprisingly good and has a lot more under the hood than I was expecting. Its roguelike elements are well-thought out, and will keep you coming back for more well after you beat the game. Online multiplayer has a variety of modes, from traditional arcade style races to entire tours across the galaxy, so that every type of player can find something to enjoy. Overall, Star Wars: Galactic Racer has just the right amount of nostalgia, and is a true evolution of the podracing experience. It’s frenetic, bombastic, and above all else, incredibly fun.","score":96,"url":"https://psxextreme.com/reviews/ps5/star-wars-galactic-racer/","date":"2026-10-05","author":"","authorSlug":null,"image":null,"publicationName":"PSX Extreme","publicationSlug":"psx-extreme","reviewedProduct":{"id":1400879668,"type":"games","title":"Star Wars: Galactic Racer","url":"/game/star-wars-galactic-racer/","criticScoreSummary":{"url":"/game/star-wars-galactic-racer/critic-reviews/?platform=playstation-5","score":88},"platform":{"id":1500000062,"name":"PlayStation 5"},"gameTaxonomy":{"game":{"id":1400879668,"name":"Star Wars: Galactic Racer"},"platform":{"id":1500000062,"name":"PlayStation 5"}}},"platform":"PlayStation 5"},{"quote":"Star Wars Galactic Racer is a spectacular surprise and a must-play for racing and Star Wars fans. It shines with exhilarating speed, excellent online support, a smart build system, and a fantastic dose of Podracing nostalgia. While its roguelite structure may not appeal to those looking for a traditional campaign, the quality of its racing and combat makes it one of the best Star Wars games in recent years.","score":95,"url":"https://www.comboinfinito.com.br/principal/star-wars-galactic-racer-review-um-burnout-com-skin-de-star-wars-e-isso-e-insano/","date":"2026-10-02","author":"","authorSlug":null,"image":null,"publicationName":"Combo Infinito","publicationSlug":"combo-infinito","reviewedProduct":{"id":1400879668,"type":"games","title":"Star Wars: Galactic Racer","url":"/game/star-wars-galactic-racer/","criticScoreSummary":{"url":"/game/star-wars-galactic-racer/critic-reviews/?platform=playstation-5","score":88},"platform":{"id":1500000062,"name":"PlayStation 5"},"gameTaxonomy":{"game":{"id":1400879668,"name":"Star Wars: Galactic Racer"},"platform":{"id":1500000062,"name":"PlayStation 5"}}},"platform":"PlayStation 5"},{"quote":"Fuse Games have truly given Millennial gamers like myself that spiritual successor to Star Wars Episode I: Racer that we never got. And to them, I give them all the grace that a post-Empire galaxy allows us.","score":95,"url":"https://gamersocialclub.ca/2026/10/02/star-wars-galactic-racer-review/","date":"2026-10-02","author":"","authorSlug":null,"image":null,"publicationName":"Gamer Social Club","publicationSlug":"gamer-social-club","reviewedProduct":{"id":1400879668,"type":"games","title":"Star Wars: Galactic Racer","url":"/game/star-wars-galactic-racer/","criticScoreSummary":{"url":"/game/star-wars-galactic-racer/critic-reviews/?platform=playstation-5","score":88},"platform":{"id":1500000062,"name":"PlayStation 5"},"gameTaxonomy":{"game":{"id":1400879668,"name":"Star Wars: Galactic Racer"},"platform":{"id":1500000062,"name":"PlayStation 5"}}},"platform":"PlayStation 5"},{"quote":"Star Wars: Galactic Racer is a spectacular and surprisingly thrilling racing game that delivers an excellent Star Wars experience through its run-based gameplay, strategic choices, and spectacular crashes.","score":95,"url":"https://nl.ign.com/star-wars-galactic-racer/167516/star-wars-galactic-racer-review","date":"2026-10-02","author":"","authorSlug":null,"image":null,"publicationName":"IGN Benelux","publicationSlug":"ign-benelux","reviewedProduct":{"id":1400879668,"type":"games","title":"Star Wars: Galactic Racer","url":"/game/star-wars-galactic-racer/","criticScoreSummary":{"url":"/game/star-wars-galactic-racer/critic-reviews/?platform=playstation-5","score":88},"platform":{"id":1500000062,"name":"PlayStation 5"},"gameTaxonomy":{"game":{"id":1400879668,"name":"Star Wars: Galactic Racer"},"platform":{"id":1500000062,"name":"PlayStation 5"}}},"platform":"PlayStation 5"}]},"links":{"self":{"href":"https://backend.metacritic.com/reviews/metacritic/critic/games/star-wars-galactic-racer/platform/playstation-5/web?offset=0&limit=10&filterBySentiment=all&sort=score&componentName=critic-reviews&componentDisplayName=critic+Reviews&componentType=ReviewList"},"prev":{"href":null},"next":{"href":"https://backend.metacritic.com/reviews/metacritic/critic/games/star-wars-galactic-racer/platform/playstation-5/web?offset=10&limit=10&filterBySentiment=all&sort=score&componentName=critic-reviews&componentDisplayName=critic+Reviews&componentType=ReviewList"},"first":{"href":"https://backend.metacritic.com/reviews/metacritic/critic/games/star-wars-galactic-racer/platform/playstation-5/web?offset=0&limit=10&filterBySentiment=all&sort=score&componentName=critic-reviews&componentDisplayName=critic+Reviews&componentType=ReviewList"},"last":{"href":"https://back